{"id":"ed638fe3d2bdf135","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-polish-topology-code.md","title":"ZFC Polish Topology Code","display":"df-zfc-polish-topology-code — ZFC Polish Topology Code","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-polish-topology-code","aliases":["58-df-zfc-polish-topology-code"],"display":"df-zfc-polish-topology-code — ZFC Polish Topology Code","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch10/58-df-complete-metric.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-polish-topology-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-polish-topology-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-polish-topology-code — ZFC Polish Topology Code"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"05d80cd20b53d8a2\" href=\"?note=05d80cd20b53d8a2\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-complete-metric.md\">../batch10/58-df-complete-metric.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md\">../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,X \\in V\">\\(c,X \\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S\\)</span> 采用各自的规范定义</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolishTopologyCode}_S \\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{PolishTopologyCode}_S \\subseteq V^2\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小等势序数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega\">\\(\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}polish\\text{-}topology\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{PolishTopologyCode}_S(c,X) \\leftrightarrow \\exists d\\exists D\\;\\left(c=\\langle d,D\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S(X,d)\\land D\\subseteq X\\land|D|\\leq\\aleph_0\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists a\\in D\\;(d(x,a)&lt;\\varepsilon)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}polish\\text{-}topology\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{PolishTopologyCode}_S(c,X) \\leftrightarrow \\exists d\\exists D\\;\\left(c=\\langle d,D\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S(X,d)\\land D\\subseteq X\\land|D|\\leq\\aleph_0\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists a\\in D\\;(d(x,a)&lt;\\varepsilon)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 是相容的完备度量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 是可数稠密集；由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 的开球可恢复编码的 Polish 拓扑。</li>\n<li>使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|D|\\leq\\aleph_0\">\\(|D|\\leq\\aleph_0\\)</span>，从而不错误排除有限 Polish 空间；同时避免误用强迫偏序上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dense}\">\\(\\mathrm{Dense}\\)</span> 谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-complete-metric.md","status":"resolved","id":"05d80cd20b53d8a2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-complete-metric.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的最小等势序数，使用 [[58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"c,X \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolishTopologyCode}_S \\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}polish\\text{-}topology\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{PolishTopologyCode}_S(c,X) \\leftrightarrow \\exists d\\exists D\\;\\left(c=\\langle d,D\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S(X,d)\\land D\\subseteq X\\land|D|\\leq\\aleph_0\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists a\\in D\\;(d(x,a)<\\varepsilon)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"|D|\\leq\\aleph_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dense}","display":false}],"bytes":1387,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3101","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-polish-topology-code.md|58-df-zfc-polish-topology-code]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","05d80cd20b53d8a2","ce876585d129ce97","2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}